<title>INDIA: India soyoil prices fall in dull market.</title>
<headline>India soyoil prices fall in dull market.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean prices were steady in central Indian markets on Thursday, but soyoil prices fell on heavy selling from plants and refineries, traders said.</p>
<p>Soymeal and rapeseed extraction prices eased on limited export demand. Soymeal yellow was quoted at $295-298 per tonne FAS (Free Alongside Ship) for export while rapeseed extraction fetched $115-116. Rapeseed extraction was quoted at 4,000 rupees per tonne FOR (Free on Rail) condition.</p>
